flowchart TB
  subgraph A[Topology A — Direct Wi-Fi to Cloud]
    D1[ESP32 + sensor] --> R1[Wi-Fi Router] --> C1[Blynk Cloud] --> U1[Phone / Browser]
  end
  subgraph B[Topology B — Local Gateway / Edge]
    D2[Sensor nodes] --> G[Local Gateway: Pi / PC]
    G -->|MQTT / HTTPS| C2[Cloud platform]
    G --> L[Local dashboard / local rules]
    C2 --> U2[Remote dashboard]
  end
  subgraph C[Topology C — Low-power remote node]
    D3[Battery sensor node] --> LP[LoRa / LPWAN link]
    LP --> GW[Gateway]
    GW --> C3[Cloud / application]
  end
